This is research code from [CLMBR](https://clmbr.shane.st) (Computation, Language and
Meaning Band of Researchers) at the University of Washington. Priorities, in order:
**correctness, reproducibility, and readability** by other researchers. Prefer simple,
explicit code over clever or highly abstracted code.

